    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >program Your Own Pocket Robot</h2></h2>In Pocket Robots you don't use a controller to fight. You program your robot through an intuitive visual interface.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/51c56119f590680b8032edacc66b061b.poster.avif?t=1723395983\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/51c56119f590680b8032edacc66b061b.webm?t=1723395983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/51c56119f590680b8032edacc66b061b.mp4?t=1723395983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >triggers and Actions</h2></h2><br>Use trigger cards such as <i>Enemy</i> or <i>Wall</i> and action cards such as <i>Dash</i>, <i>Attack</i> or <i>Jump</i> to beat your enemies !<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/df5bcd6ef4fa20d073d56baf04637923.poster.avif?t=1723395983\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/df5bcd6ef4fa20d073d56baf04637923.webm?t=1723395983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/df5bcd6ef4fa20d073d56baf04637923.mp4?t=1723395983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >dozens Of Special Moves</h2></h2><br><i>Shockwave</i>, <i>Dash attack</i>, <i>Counter</i>, <i>Shield</i>, <i>Air Crash</i>, <i>Charged attack</i>, <i>Mines</i>, <i>Magic Projectiles</i> and countless others. Surprise your opponents with powerful (but energy-costly) moves.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/85413fd8bcb9c06dbd2b189b79c94373.poster.avif?t=1723395983\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/85413fd8bcb9c06dbd2b189b79c94373.webm?t=1723395983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/85413fd8bcb9c06dbd2b189b79c94373.mp4?t=1723395983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >customize Each Card</h2></h2><br>Every card, whether trigger or action, can be customized in countless ways to suit your AI strategy. Examples:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Enemy in sight: customize how far the enemy has to be for a trigger to activate.<br></li><li> Dash: customize your dash move, direction, strength and other parameters.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/3706b93889fff14cebb95de0a24e4100.avif?t=1723395983\" width=616 height=308 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >multiplayer</h2></h2><br>May the best coder win ! Fight your friends offline or online in an epic multiplayer mode. Scan a QR code and program your robot on your phone ! Or use a web browser if you're playing online.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/a9d580b410bf59df3e6476b2761d764b.avif?t=1723395983\" width=616 height=410 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >solo Mode</h2></h2>Don't like playing with people ? We got you covered ! Fight the miscoded in the solo mode and travel through many worlds ! These formidable foes were injected a malicious program so be ready ! Teach your robot how to navigate through post-apocalytic levels filled with platforms, enemies, dangerous traps and a mysterious lore.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/e7bb82b3c7467376ab76ca62a6148503.avif?t=1723395983\" width=616 height=348 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >unleash the Programmer Inside You</h2></h2>Your robot knows what to do when it sees an enemy ? Great ! But what when it does <strong>not</strong> see an enemy ? Or even more: what if you want to do some specific action when you are facing a wall <strong>and</strong> your health is below 40 % ? Learn to master programming tools such as boolean logic (NOT, AND and OR) and variables (health, energy, heat, speed, etc.) to become invincible !<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/6b25bf5ccc301d890b0c866c4780fbe8.avif?t=1723395983\" width=616 height=448 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >master Your Surroundings</h2></h2>Make sure your robot knows how to use the environment to improve your chance of success. See a trap ? Maybe there is a way of pushing the opponent in it. See an obstacle ? Maybe you could use it as protection ?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/9788adcfdba74d3c3671ac0c5af0725f.avif?t=1723395983\" width=616 height=336 /></span><br><br><br><br>Want to follow the development of Pocket Robots ? Have ideas for new moves ? General suggestions for the game ? Join the Discord server !",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >program Your Own Pocket Robot</h2></h2>In Pocket Robots you don't use a controller to fight. You program your robot through an intuitive visual interface.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/51c56119f590680b8032edacc66b061b.poster.avif?t=1723395983\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/51c56119f590680b8032edacc66b061b.webm?t=1723395983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/51c56119f590680b8032edacc66b061b.mp4?t=1723395983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >triggers and Actions</h2></h2><br>Use trigger cards such as <i>Enemy</i> or <i>Wall</i> and action cards such as <i>Dash</i>, <i>Attack</i> or <i>Jump</i> to beat your enemies !<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/df5bcd6ef4fa20d073d56baf04637923.poster.avif?t=1723395983\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/df5bcd6ef4fa20d073d56baf04637923.webm?t=1723395983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/df5bcd6ef4fa20d073d56baf04637923.mp4?t=1723395983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >dozens Of Special Moves</h2></h2><br><i>Shockwave</i>, <i>Dash attack</i>, <i>Counter</i>, <i>Shield</i>, <i>Air Crash</i>, <i>Charged attack</i>, <i>Mines</i>, <i>Magic Projectiles</i> and countless others. Surprise your opponents with powerful (but energy-costly) moves.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/85413fd8bcb9c06dbd2b189b79c94373.poster.avif?t=1723395983\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/85413fd8bcb9c06dbd2b189b79c94373.webm?t=1723395983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/85413fd8bcb9c06dbd2b189b79c94373.mp4?t=1723395983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >customize Each Card</h2></h2><br>Every card, whether trigger or action, can be customized in countless ways to suit your AI strategy. Examples:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Enemy in sight: customize how far the enemy has to be for a trigger to activate.<br></li><li> Dash: customize your dash move, direction, strength and other parameters.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/3706b93889fff14cebb95de0a24e4100.avif?t=1723395983\" width=616 height=308 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >multiplayer</h2></h2><br>May the best coder win ! Fight your friends offline or online in an epic multiplayer mode. Scan a QR code and program your robot on your phone ! Or use a web browser if you're playing online.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/a9d580b410bf59df3e6476b2761d764b.avif?t=1723395983\" width=616 height=410 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >solo Mode</h2></h2>Don't like playing with people ? We got you covered ! Fight the miscoded in the solo mode and travel through many worlds ! These formidable foes were injected a malicious program so be ready ! Teach your robot how to navigate through post-apocalytic levels filled with platforms, enemies, dangerous traps and a mysterious lore.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/e7bb82b3c7467376ab76ca62a6148503.avif?t=1723395983\" width=616 height=348 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >unleash the Programmer Inside You</h2></h2>Your robot knows what to do when it sees an enemy ? Great ! But what when it does <strong>not</strong> see an enemy ? Or even more: what if you want to do some specific action when you are facing a wall <strong>and</strong> your health is below 40 % ? Learn to master programming tools such as boolean logic (NOT, AND and OR) and variables (health, energy, heat, speed, etc.) to become invincible !<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/6b25bf5ccc301d890b0c866c4780fbe8.avif?t=1723395983\" width=616 height=448 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >master Your Surroundings</h2></h2>Make sure your robot knows how to use the environment to improve your chance of success. See a trap ? Maybe there is a way of pushing the opponent in it. See an obstacle ? Maybe you could use it as protection ?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939940/extras/9788adcfdba74d3c3671ac0c5af0725f.avif?t=1723395983\" width=616 height=336 /></span><br><br><br><br>Want to follow the development of Pocket Robots ? Have ideas for new moves ? General suggestions for the game ? Join the Discord server !",
